{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Mush Dash&quot; </strong> is a multiplayer party game with up to seven people racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to complete it to the target point by avoiding various patterns of obstacles and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the special trap of Mush Dash</strong>! (Not easy)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/bd831ea0005bf795ea2043cef87d85e5.poster.avif?t=1756261419\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/bd831ea0005bf795ea2043cef87d85e5.webm?t=1756261419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/bd831ea0005bf795ea2043cef87d85e5.mp4?t=1756261419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mush Dash consists of five waves per theme, and three waves are randomly determined at the start of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/b1bab4b895e04ad70b527e265567d107.poster.avif?t=1756261419\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/b1bab4b895e04ad70b527e265567d107.webm?t=1756261419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/b1bab4b895e04ad70b527e265567d107.mp4?t=1756261419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all three waves are over, the rankings are tallied to determine the final winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also important to finish the wave first, but the more mushroom coins you collect through a number of challenges, the closer you are to winning the final championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>jumping over several traps and obstacles </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Mushroom Coins to Win Final! </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3153140?t=1756261419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/af16e9605ce9e2c81d62bf68d88b349bfc9d8ae7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756261419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/5b4046ddd502d7dc2abec101c77944b59768fef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756261419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/5b4046ddd502d7dc2abec101c77944b59768fef9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756261419","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Mush Dash&quot; </strong> is a multiplayer party game with up to seven people racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to complete it to the target point by avoiding various patterns of obstacles and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the special trap of Mush Dash</strong>! (Not easy)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar